{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29071","headline":"南海府罢归京口经大庾岭赠张明府 · 许浑","name":"南海府罢归京口经大庾岭赠张明府","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"楼船旌斾极天涯，一剑从军两鬓华。\n回日眼明河畔草，去时肠断岭头花。\n陶诗尽写行过县，张赋初成卧到家。\n官满知君有归处，姑苏台上旧烟霞。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"许浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_29071.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_29071","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}